abstract: >-
  A three-role private language-model runtime using offline seeded preparation,
  one-use masked integer stages, a client-local Responses interface, and
  composition-bound experiments with cohort-scoped evidence.
keywords:
  - private inference
  - additive masking
  - language models
  - offline correlations
